3315533369,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FnwY5","user":{"login":"WhalesState","id":53877170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODc3MTcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53877170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState","html_url":"https://github.com/WhalesState","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-21T06:15:28Z","updated_at":"2025-09-21T06:15:28Z","body":"> Somewhat curious: what's your display scale set to? I have an theory this may be related to fractional scaling, since my laptop screen is set to 150% scale and the window seems to (roughly) scale itself up by 50% each time.\n\nMy display scale is the default 100%, i will change it and test again.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315533369/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315537925","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110643#issuecomment-3315537925","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110643","id":3315537925,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FnxgF","user":{"login":"WhalesState","id":53877170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODc3MTcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53877170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState","html_url":"https://github.com/WhalesState","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-21T06:26:18Z","updated_at":"2025-09-21T06:29:01Z","body":"I still can't reproduce it with 150% display scale, I'd suggest that you enable verbose output from Project Settings `debug/settings/stdout/verbose_stdout` and restarting the editor <s>if needed</s> since wayland display server prints many helpful debug messages.\n\n<img width=\"968\" height=\"422\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6b45534c-09ae-4661-af72-5394cea63651\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315537925/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315777331","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110643#issuecomment-3315777331","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110643","id":3315777331,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7For8z","user":{"login":"ctrlaltmilk","id":38171793,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MTcxNzkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38171793?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlaltmilk","html_url":"https://github.com/ctrlaltmilk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlaltmilk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlaltmilk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlaltmilk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlaltmilk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlaltmilk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlaltmilk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlaltmilk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlaltmilk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlaltmilk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-21T08:44:16Z","updated_at":"2025-09-21T08:44:16Z","body":"Opening the first time:\n```\nShowing window 2\nCreating regular window of size (1504, 891)\nResizing the window from (1504, 891) to (2256, 1337) (fractional scale x1.500000).\nResizing the window from (1504, 891) to (2256, 1337) (fractional scale x1.500000).\nlibdecor frame on configure rect [P: (0, 0), S: (1504, 891)]\nResizing the window from (1504, 891) to (2256, 1337) (fractional scale x1.500000).\n```\nOpening the second time:\n```\nCreating regular window of size (2256, 1337)\nResizing the window from (2256, 1337) to (3384, 2006) (fractional scale x1.500000).\nResizing the window from (2256, 1337) to (3384, 2006) (fractional scale x1.500000).\nlibdecor frame on configure rect [P: (0, 0), S: (2256, 1337)]\nResizing the window from (2256, 1337) to (3384, 2006) (fractional scale x1.500000).\n```\n\nIt looks like when the editor UI scale (Editor Settings > Interface > Editor > Display Scale) is set to more than 100%, the stored window size is multiplied by the scaling factor, then stored after the multiplication. This leads to the window growing with each open/close cycle.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315777331/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3316012281","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110643#issuecomment-3316012281","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110643","id":3316012281,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FplT5","user":{"login":"WhalesState","id":53877170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODc3MTcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53877170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState","html_url":"https://github.com/WhalesState","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-21T13:57:47Z","updated_at":"2025-09-21T13:57:47Z","body":"Please check if https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110746 fixes the issue for you without causing any regressions.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3316012281/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3361437713","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110643#issuecomment-3361437713","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110643","id":3361437713,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IW3gR","user":{"login":"brady-goldsworthy","id":34688945,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0Njg4OTQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34688945?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-goldsworthy","html_url":"https://github.com/brady-goldsworthy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-goldsworthy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-goldsworthy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-goldsworthy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-goldsworthy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-goldsworthy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-goldsworthy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-goldsworthy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-goldsworthy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-goldsworthy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-02T14:18:32Z","updated_at":"2025-10-02T14:18:32Z","body":"As a workaround until this gets fixed, putting the editor into single window mode seems to prevent the popup window from growing beyond the size of the editor. \n\nIn my case, the window had grown so large that it was causing crashes, this prevents that.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3361437713/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3603901658","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110643#issuecomment-3603901658","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110643","id":3603901658,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Wzyza","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-02T20:47:40Z","updated_at":"2025-12-02T20:47:40Z","body":"Hi, I've investigated the issue further, Thank you for your patience :D\n\nTurns out that this whole thing is quite a bit more complicated than I expected. Window scaling is a _very_ tricky thing, especially when it comes to retrofitting existing tech.\n\nThe main issue here is that Godot always expects complete control over the window size, which in this case is always the same as the underlying buffer. This is quite different from Wayland, which has \"logical\" units, a bit like MacOS from what I can tell.\n\nI made a completely different assumption, and simply returned whatever the window manager told us (which is good practice), scaled to match the \"absolute\" units that Godot expects. The obvious issue here is that the engine can't really distinguish between scaling and other actions, and thus it assumes that the user made the window bigger. Rinse and repeat, and here we are. The only feasible solution I found for now is to do the opposite, and scale down the \"compositor window\" to match the buffer, so that Godot does not see changes in size.\n\nThe annoying part is that we need now to define when to \"shrink\" the window to fit Godot's expectations and when to follow the size told to us by the compositor. This will require quite a bit of elbow grease to figure out and rework the code. Hopefully this is also a good excuse to fix other resize-related issues as they're somewhat related.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3603901658/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3619362056","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110643#issuecomment-3619362056","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110643","id":3619362056,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7XuxUI","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-06T02:41:05Z","updated_at":"2025-12-06T02:41:05Z","body":"Ok change of plans. Making the window \"shrink\" to the buffer is very, _very_ annoying and this might even go against good dynamic DPI support in the future.\n\nI'm currently proposing the following workaround: #113656\n\nPlease give it a shot :D","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3619362056/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3622129959","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110643#issuecomment-3622129959","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110643","id":3622129959,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7X5VEn","user":{"login":"eobet","id":3254196,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTQxOTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3254196?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet","html_url":"https://github.com/eobet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-07T14:00:42Z","updated_at":"2025-12-07T14:00:42Z","body":"Seems related possibly:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113710","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3622129959/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]